 walks of life meet as journalism majors and develop a lasting friendship that guides them through the journey of growing up."},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"机智的上半场","overview":"该剧从四名刚刚迈入大学校园的女生的视角展开，讲述了她们在大学四年中的成长故事。\n\n九月一号，假小子夏朗朗，富家小姐樊潇雨，公主病皇甫淑敏，老干部杨嘉倩这四个不同地方的十八岁姑娘来到大学新闻系报道，开始了她们欢乐的大学生活。四人因为性格和生活习惯不断有摩擦，一同成长和蜕变后，最终相互理解，成为挚友。因想摆脱父亲的束缚，樊潇雨一直想尽办法自力更生，在和师哥范轻舟一起创业的过程中越走越近，明白了如何去爱。皇甫淑敏在和重庆男孩周虞互怼式交往中渐生情愫，在收获爱情的同时也学会了独立。杨嘉倩在一次不小心暴露身份后，决定面对自己，敢于向母亲表达真实的想法。夏朗朗在辅导员麦蒙的理解和鼓励中，卸下自卑的外壳，也重拾粉红少女心。四人在亲情，友情，爱情中完成了与父母的和解，重塑自我，逐渐长成更好的自己，为大学生活画上了完满的句号"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/58SzX9opyIDOxor73d3nYpHd5pz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aFAhmaWh0KjYLHKByYI9tShG2bm.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":24,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ShwbxFFMIILo31xV849HTPiXsk.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/129349/season/1"}],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":129349,"type":"tv","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sJVnEi58Ik368gT4VlEwOOb0Otc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sJVnEi58Ik368gT4VlEwOOb0Otc.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sJVnEi58Ik368gT4VlEwOOb0Otc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sJVnEi58Ik368gT4VlEwOOb0Otc.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tiLMMkkm8FClDAvwbsa9NG04DCJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tiLMMkkm8FClDAvwbsa9NG04DCJ.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"zh":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.